    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, i think i misunderstood what u meant by \"can't use similar logic.\" the clause says \"the Receiving Party shall be free to use for any purpose the Residuals\". if the clause says i'm \"free to use\" them, why did u say i can't use them without permission? i'm trying to figure out where the line is between the actual confidential code and just general stuff i learned. like if i learn a better way to structure a database during this project, is that a \"residual\" i can take with me?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
